  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For the reaction</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#8652;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p><p>the value of equilibrium constant is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>. If the initial concentration of all the three species is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math>&nbsp;each, then the equilibrium concentration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> is _______.&nbsp;(Nearest integer)</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "25",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0045_c5695ea6e873.png\" style=\"width: 173px; height: 126px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mfenced><mi>eq</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mi>eq</mi></msub><msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mfenced><mi>eq</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math></p>"
